{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>【Now新聞台】全港官立及資助小學今日(11月23日)公布明年九月入讀小一的學校自行分配學位錄取名單。另外，國產郵輪愛達花城號在南沙啟航後，今日停靠啟德郵輪碼頭。</p><p>採訪日誌｜小一入學自行分配學位結果公布／愛達花城號停靠啟德郵輪碼頭</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T00:04:14.311540+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T23:43:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T23:57:45.160905+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T23:57:45.160905+00:00","content_hash":"03588b1ee9fee08939d000443fff0529321b478dc922c93ccf369a03eb3abfc6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}